
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GitHub Workshop Meme</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #101820, #243b55);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
}
.card {
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 20px;
  padding: 30px;
  background: #fff;
  color: #17202a;
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 35px #0006;
}
h1 { color: #238636; }
.meme { font-size: 65px; }
p { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; }
.tag { color: #238636; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="meme">😎 💻 🚀</div>
    <h1>GitHub Workshop</h1>
    <p><b>Me before the workshop:</b><br>
    "I just write code."</p>
    <p><b>Me after learning Git:</b><br>
    "Commit. Push. Flex. Repeat."</p>
    <p class="tag">One small commit for me,<br>
    one giant push to GitHub!</p>
    <p> #GitHubWorkshop #CodeLife </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
